🚗 Turbo Fix Automotive Website

Project Overview

Turbo Fix Automotive is a professional automotive repair and maintenance website developed as part of the WEDE5121 Web Development module. The purpose of the website is to provide customers with information about the company, its services, and ways to contact the business or submit service enquiries.

The website has been designed to be user-friendly, visually appealing, and accessible across different devices. It incorporates HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Search Engine Optimisation (SEO) techniques to improve functionality and user experience.

⸻

Business Description

Turbo Fix Automotive is a vehicle repair and maintenance company dedicated to providing reliable and affordable automotive services. The business specialises in vehicle diagnostics, engine repairs, brake repairs, oil changes, battery replacements, and routine vehicle servicing.

The company focuses on customer satisfaction, quality workmanship, and efficient service delivery.

⸻

Website Goals

The goals of the website are:

* Promote Turbo Fix Automotive and its services.
* Provide customers with information about the business.
* Allow customers to submit service enquiries online.
* Allow customers to contact the business directly.
* Improve the company’s online visibility through SEO practices.
* Create a professional online presence for the business.

⸻

Website Pages

Home Page (index.html)

The Home page introduces visitors to Turbo Fix Automotive and provides an overview of the company’s services and value proposition.

Services Page (services.html)

The Services page provides detailed information about the automotive services offered by the company.

About Page (about.html)

The About page explains the history, mission, vision, and values of Turbo Fix Automotive.

Enquiry Page (enquiry.html)

The Enquiry page allows customers to request information about services and obtain assistance regarding automotive repairs and maintenance.

Contact Page (contact.html)

The Contact page allows users to send general messages and contact the company directly.

⸻

